Privacy Policy for Zombie Runner

Last updated: semtemper 30, 2026

Zombie Runner respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how information may be collected, used, and protected when you use our mobile game.

Information We Collect

Zombie Runner may collect limited information automatically to help improve the game, maintain performance, and provide advertisements. This information may include:

- Device information, such as device model and operating system
- App performance and crash information
- General usage information
- Advertising identifiers
- Approximate location information, if collected by advertising or analytics services

Zombie Runner does not require users to create an account and does not intentionally collect names, phone numbers, email addresses, contacts, or precise location information.

Advertising

Zombie Runner may display advertisements provided by third-party advertising services, such as Google AdMob.

These services may collect and use certain information, including advertising identifiers, device information, and general usage data, to provide, measure, and improve advertisements. Personalized or non-personalized ads may be shown depending on your device settings, location, and applicable laws.

Game Data

Game progress, scores, settings, and other game-related information may be stored locally on your device. If the game includes cloud saving in the future, this Privacy Policy may be updated.

Analytics and App Performance

We may use analytics or app performance services to understand how the game is used, identify crashes, fix technical problems, and improve gameplay.

Data Sharing

Information may be shared with trusted third-party service providers only when necessary to provide advertising, analytics, app functionality, security, or technical support.

We do not sell your personal information.

Children’s Privacy

Zombie Runner is not designed to knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe that a child has provided personal information through the game, please contact us so that appropriate action can be taken.

Data Security

We take reasonable measures to protect information. However, no method of electronic storage or internet transmission is completely secure.

Third-Party Services

Zombie Runner may use third-party services that have their own privacy policies. These services may include:

- Google Play Services
- Google AdMob
- Google Analytics or Firebase, if enabled

We encourage users to review the privacy policies of these third-party services.

Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy when the game or its services change. Any updates will be posted on this page, and the “Last updated” date will be changed.

